    "what_it_is": "The MicroVention Low-Profile Visualized Intraluminal Support (LVIS) and LVIS Jr. device is a self-expanding nickel titanium, single wire braid, compliant, closed-cell design that can be deployed and retrieved by a single operator. The LVIS/LVIS Jr. device is sterile and non-pyrogenic and is packaged as a single unit with an introducer sheath and a detachable push wire.",
